+/**
+ * SSRS2: while on (for the calling thread), a prototype object whose properties change is left in dictionary mode
+ * rather than made fast again after each change, as V8 does once inline caches used it (each time linear in its
+ * properties: redefining a used prototype's n accessors one by one, WebIDL's shapes applied to a host's classes, took
+ * n * n). Only how fast its properties are found changes; turn it off, then OptimizePrototype each object changed.
+ */
